291
00:18:35,730 --> 00:18:39,490
Oh, well, you know, the gala had to end sometime.

292
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,570
Don't go anywhere. I'll be right back.

293
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:43,990
- Yeah, sure.      - All right?

294
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,700
